    <h2>6. Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What is the difference between sand and crush?</h3>
        <p>
            Sand is a fine aggregate, while crush is a coarse aggregate
            produced by crushing rocks. Both have different roles in construction.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What is 3/4-inch crush used for?</h3>
        <p>
            It is commonly used in concrete applications such as slabs,
